# {{ name }}

{{ description }}

## Installation

```bash
php artisan plugin:install {{ alias }}
```

## Structure

- `src/app` — controllers, middleware, requests, models, and this plugin's service provider
- `src/config` — configuration, merged under the `{{ alias }}` key
- `src/database` — migrations, factories, and seeders
- `src/lang` — translations, registered under the `{{ alias }}` namespace
- `src/resources/views` — views, registered under the `{{ alias }}` namespace
- `src/routes` — `web.php`, `api.php`, and `console.php`
- `src/public` — assets published to `/plugins/{{ alias }}`
